    "chunk_text": "it israhel de medio eius. On strang strangre & earme heaum In manu forti et brachio excelso. Se tod\u00e6lde s\u00e6 reade on tod\u00e6lydnysse Qui diuisit mare rubrum in diuisiones. & utal\u00e6dde \u00feurh midel his Et eduxit israhel per medium eius. Aswegde & weryde his on s\u00e6 readre Et excussit pharaonem et exercitum eius in mari rubro. Se al\u00e6dde folc his \u00feurh westyn Qui transduxit populum suum per desertum. Se utal\u00e6dde w\u00e6tyr of stane clyfys se sloh cynyngas micle Qui eduxit aquam de petra rupis qui & he ofsloh cynyngas wundorlice Et occidit reges mirabiles. Seon cyning amorrea Seon regem amorreorum. & og cyning basan & ealle & ricu chanaanys he ofsloh Et og regem basan et omnia regna chanaan & sealde eor\u00f0an hyra yrfeweardnysse Et dedit terram eorum hereditatem. Yrfe israhelys \u00feeowe his hereditatem israhel seruo suo. For\u00feon on eadmodnysse ure gemyndig w\u00e6s ure drihtyn Quia in humilitate nostra memor fuit nostri & he alysy\u00f0 us of handa feonda ure Et redemit nos de manu inimicorum nostrorum. Se syly\u00f0 mete \u00e6lcum fl\u00e6sce Qui dat escam omni carni. Andytta\u00f0 gode hefynys andytta\u00f0 drihtne drihtna for\u00feon god for\u00feon on worulde mildheortnys his Ofyr flodas babilonys \u00fe\u00e6r we s\u00e6tvn & weopun \u00fea \u00fea we w\u00e6ron gemyndige \u00feinys sion Svper On sealum on midle his we hengon organan ure In sallicibus in medio eius suspendimus organa For\ufffd",
